# Claude Code — context layer is tracked (skills, rules, settings, launch config).
# Personal overrides and machine-local state stay out.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/projects/
CLAUDE.local.md

# Security assessment — stays local. This repository is public, and the audit
# is a ranked exploit map for defects that are still open in production
# (forgeable payment webhook, roster IDORs, exposed payment data). Publishing
# it hands out a working attack guide, and git history is permanent.
# Share it privately; commit it only once the P0 findings are closed.
assessment/

# Local database dumps — may contain real player data. The hand-written schema
# files (schema.sql, add_indexes.sql, payment_balance_trigger.sql) are tracked
# deliberately; only full dumps are excluded.
dump*.sql
*.dump

# Logs
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
